  "limitations": [
    "The biological published model example is not documented as an independent held-out field; no 3-D accuracy score is claimed.",
    "The published NPY example was losslessly re-containerized as an explicit ZYX TIFF for raw-path acceptance; it is not a claimed untouched vendor acquisition file.",
    "Physical voxel spacing for the packaged example is not documented. Relative anisotropy2 was explicit from the model training geometry; Measure reports px_xy, not micrometres.",
    "Raw 3-D ingest requires one explicit ZYX TIFF series per field/channel. Individual plane-file vendor layouts, multiseries/time-series, test-mode sampling and illumination/PSF preprocessing are refused.",
    "Make Masks current acceptance calls its real loader and detector entry points on the official 2-D nucleus example; it is not a GUI button-click replay or a new 3-D editor.",
    "No GPU execution. Large data/model files remain private and are not committed."
  ],
